     Magic portals are traps; wand of secret door detection,
spell of detect unseen, and using charged, non-cursed Bell of
Opening all work to reveal traps which are in line of sight
and within a relatively short range (throwing distance as a
rough approximation).  The elemental planes pose problems for
that because of distance and because stone, water, and clouds
all block line of sight.  [Planes of Water and Air have been
changed to allow detection magic to penetrate water and clouds
even though vision doesn't; C343-340.  But you'll still need
to arrive at a position which has line of sight to the portal
in order to realize that it got successfully detected.]

