     The fact that the portal moves on Water doesn't really
matter.  Once it has been detected as a trap, it will be
revealed on the map whenever you can see it, even when the
location has changed since detection or last sighting.  Of
course the bubble movement makes getting close enough to see
it be harder to accomplish.  And the fact that with 3.4.3 you
need to already be inside the same bubble when detecting does
make secret door detection not very effective for finding it.


